8. Difference: WebSocket vs HTTP
| Feature       | HTTP                  | WebSocket      |
| ------------- | --------------------- | -------------- |
| Communication | Request/Response      | Two-way        |
| Connection    | Closed after response | Persistent     |
| Latency       | Higher                | Very low       |
| Use case      | APIs                  | Real-time apps |

